#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:26
msgid ""
"Insight UI can installed as usual via a Python package manager such as "
"<b>pip</b> or <b>uv</b>."
msgstr ""
"Insight UI kann wie gewohnt über einen Python Paketmanager wie <b>pip</b> "
"oder <b>uv</b> installiert werden."

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:39
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "Schnellstart"

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:41
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Step 1 is to add %(insight_ui)s to the "
"%(installed_apps)s in <b>settings.py</b>:\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Schritt Nr. 1 ist es, %(insight_ui)s zu den %(installed_apps)s in der "
"<b>settings.py</b> hinzufügen:"

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:56
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        Then the development server can be started "
"%(command)s.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Anschließend kann der Entwicklungsserver gestartet werden %(command)s."

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:64
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        To use all features of Insight UI, our "
"%(link_open)sBase Template%(link_close)s must be included.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Um alle Funktionen von Insight UI verwenden zu können, muss unser "
"%(link_open)sBasis-Template%(link_close)s eingebunden werden."

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:74
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        In order for the Insight UI configuration to be "
"loaded, the corresponding variables must be loaded into the context.\n"
"                        The configuration must be passed in every view that "
"uses the base template. See also %(link_open)sCustomization%(link_close)s.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Zum Laden der Konfiguration von Insight UI müssen die entsprechende "
"Variablen in den Kontext geladen werden. Dazu muss die Konfiguration in "
"jeder View, welche das Basis-Template verwendet, übergeben werden. Siehe "
"auch %(link_open)sAnpassung%(link_close)s."

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:93
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"                        To also be able to use the components, the "
"%(insight_tags)s must always be loaded in a respective template.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Um nun auch noch die Komponenten verwenden zu können, müssen zusätzlich noch "
"die %(insight_tags)s im jeweiligen Template geladen werden."

#: insight_ui/templates/insight_ui/docs/installation.html:105
